# The image build's pi phase runs `npm ci` and `tsc` in this directory, inside
# the checkout, because it is a mounted build source. Neither output belongs in
# git, and `ai/.gitignore` is a Rust one - this is the only Node package under
# it, so nothing here was covered and a build left thousands of untracked files
# for the next `git add` to sweep in.
node_modules
dist
